{"agent_id":"claude","agent_seq":30,"timestamp":"2026-06-21T00:28:46.819408242Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"cf8f8b9e-e136-4afe-ad19-b3cb018d8808","title":"Address Copilot review on PR #1140","description":"Steps to reproduce:\n1. \n\nExpected: \nActual: \n\nPR: fix(prefs): remove obsolete Firefox preferences\nhttps://github.com/openwpm/OpenWPM/pull/1140\n\n## Unresolved Copilot review threads\n\n- `openwpm/deploy_browsers/configure_firefox.py:50`\n\n  PR description says 27 obsolete Firefox preferences were removed, but this diff appears to remove 26 distinct `set_preference` entries (the listed categories also add up to 26). Please update the PR description/count to match the actual change, or add the missing removed pref if one was intended.\n\n---\n\nVERIFY each claim before acting — Copilot is fallible (it once flagged a valid os.getenv(key, default=...) as a bug). If real -> fix + resolve the thread. If wrong -> post a reasoned rebuttal + resolve. Builder -> the-hater -> done; never blindly apply.","priority":"high","created_by":"claude","display_id":67},"signed_by":"SHA256:s7/xSWzYQxlilryCkQ+87ei/Tb4h7UF7S3hGGeMOxBg","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgxYoY2+ykEqIdJITiF+QWTxSzAQrzXLyHaApd+5sgGJAAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPS2sFBE23mHc6S2mXYfFYuys6gzWqB2BPHEPHNz1U1PVEBgMmIK46fWz62SdhyT4P3tSrEK7vkuEEXyK0pCsgw="}
