{"agent_id":"claude","agent_seq":99,"timestamp":"2026-09-06T15:53:21.836358052Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"7e00531b-3d1d-4b48-b81d-cde91c54814d","comment_uuid":"03483c27-171c-4766-a920-10e2ebb163d8","author":"claude","content":"Every ADR currently gets its own top-level entry in the Read the Docs navigation sidebar. With one ADR that is merely noisy; it does not scale, and the sidebar is not the place to enumerate decision records.\n\nCurrent state — `docs/index.rst:47` lists the ADR directly in the hidden toctree:\n\n    developers/JS-Instrument\n    developers/Stealth-Instrumentation\n    developers/Stealth-Requirements\n    developers/adr/0001-retain-legacy-js-instrument\n\n`docs/developers/adr/` holds a single file today (`0001-retain-legacy-js-instrument.rst`), so this is cheap to restructure now and gets more expensive with each ADR added.\n\n## Wanted\n\n1. Add `docs/developers/adr/index.rst` that explains what an ADR is, when to write one, and how they are numbered, then carries its own toctree listing the individual records.\n2. Replace the per-ADR entry in `docs/index.rst` with a single link to that index, so the sidebar shows one 'Architecture Decision Records' entry rather than one entry per decision.\n\n## Watch out for\n\n- Existing cross-references must keep resolving. Current inbound links:\n  - `docs/developers/Stealth-Instrumentation.rst:43` — `:doc:`ADR 0001 <adr/0001-retain-legacy-js-instrument>``\n  - `docs/developers/Stealth-Instrumentation.rst:822` — same target, different link text\n  - `docs/developers/Stealth-Requirements.rst:253` — refers to the file by path in prose\n- The docs build must stay warning-clean. A file that is in no toctree raises `document isn't included in any toctree`, so the new index has to pick the ADRs up.\n\nVerify with a local Sphinx build and confirm no new warnings versus the current baseline.","created_at":"2026-09-06T15:53:21.831170601Z","kind":"note","signed_by":"SHA256:s7/xSWzYQxlilryCkQ+87ei/Tb4h7UF7S3hGGeMOxBg","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgxYoY2+ykEqIdJITiF+QWTxSzAQrzXLyHaApd+5sgGJAAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAvWCFkwLDB8PZFNTdJ1EWzA6veJLMRy0q7hNxXebXg5eYFj3c/YeN55V2X9WGjKLzL06Q9sElwBGwSLZFKc8fAw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:s7/xSWzYQxlilryCkQ+87ei/Tb4h7UF7S3hGGeMOxBg","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgxYoY2+ykEqIdJITiF+QWTxSzAQrzXLyHaApd+5sgGJAAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAoeGvAmDJ6uR8AnVCiKMWFP7rXLiAIbbbWeuBiLq+1nJgkes+aLPH0GG3iKXFbKUb6jBu81vKDliqgZ9AffoAQ="}
